Third-party code quoted in the documentation
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files under `docs/research/`, and parts of `AUDIT.md`, quote excerpts of
source code from 应用 (AI Assistant), published by DeepSeek. Those excerpts are
included so that every research conclusion in this repository can be traced
back to the exact implementation it was derived from, instead of resting on an
unverifiable assertion.

Those excerpts are:

  Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The quoted material is limited to the minimum needed to document a finding.
It is not part of this plugin's runtime code: nothing under `docs/` ships in the
published package (see the `files` field in `package.json`), and `client.js`
contains no copied 应用 source.

Upstream packages quoted, with their declared licenses as shipped:

  @deepseek-ai/dsh                     MIT
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-workspace MIT
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar   MIT
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout    MIT
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer  MIT
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-api-workspace-controller MIT

Every excerpt is annotated with the `file:line` anchor it came from (for
example `WS:1091` for `dsh-client-ui-workspace/lib/client.js` line 1091), so a
reader can verify it against the installed application.

